    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "legend_t",
      "x": 920,
      "y": 812,
      "width": 1200,
      "height": 160,
      "text": "STRIDE chapters (solid arrows)\nI01 User signs in and calls the API     I02 Org saves Anthropic key     I03 Design agent → Anthropic\nI04 Browser joins collab     I05 Job dispatch + callback     I06 GitHub App (public repos)     I07 Webhook merge/build/deploy\n\nNamed only (no STRIDE chapter): listed on the left and on the dataplane boxes. N5 and N7 are folded into I07.",
      "originalText": "STRIDE chapters (solid arrows)\nI01 User signs in and calls the API     I02 Org saves Anthropic key     I03 Design agent → Anthropic\nI04 Browser joins collab     I05 Job dispatch + callback     I06 GitHub App (public repos)     I07 Webhook merge/build/deploy\n\nNamed only (no STRIDE chapter): listed on the left and on the dataplane boxes. N5 and N7 are folded into I07.",
